    <title>v0.31.1rc0: [Metrics] Expose cached prompt tokens by cache tier (#56318)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Signed-off-by: Cam Quilici &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:cjquilici@gmail.com&quot;&gt;cjquilici@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Signed-off-by: Cam Quilici &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:cameron@semianalysis.com&quot;&gt;cameron@semianalysis.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Co-authored-by: Cam Quilici &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:cameron@semianalysis.com&quot;&gt;cameron@semianalysis.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Co-authored-by: Nick Hill &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:nickhill123@gmail.com&quot;&gt;nickhill123@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Co-authored-by: Yifan Qiao &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:yifanqiao@inferact.ai&quot;&gt;yifanqiao@inferact.ai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
