  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/599547518/v0.31.0</id>
    <updated>2026-10-06T06:49:35Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/tag/v0.31.0"/>
    <title>v0.31.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;v0.31.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release features 717 commits from 307 contributors (96 new)!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash performance&lt;/strong&gt;: FlashMLA mega attention with the V4.1 NVFP4 compressed KV cache is now the SM100 default (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5457082922&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56935&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56935/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56935&quot;&gt;#56935&lt;/a&gt;); DeepGEMM sparse MQA logits for the indexer (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5410999836&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56254&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56254/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56254&quot;&gt;#56254&lt;/a&gt;) and Mega-Gate fusing the gate GEMM with expert selection (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5412210676&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56266&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56266/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56266&quot;&gt;#56266&lt;/a&gt;); decoder boundaries fuse the TP all-reduce, mHC input preparation (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5505837861&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57643&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57643/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57643&quot;&gt;#57643&lt;/a&gt;) and the MoE finalize (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5571319052&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58586&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58586/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58586&quot;&gt;#58586&lt;/a&gt;); a fused small-batch WO-A with inverse RoPE and MXFP8 quant on SM100/SM103 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5575634306&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58634&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58634/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58634&quot;&gt;#58634&lt;/a&gt;); the MXFP8 &lt;code&gt;wo_b&lt;/code&gt; GEMM fused with the sequence-parallel reduce-scatter (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5491277453&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57428&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57428/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57428&quot;&gt;#57428&lt;/a&gt;); Engram &lt;code&gt;wkv&lt;/code&gt; sharded across TP ranks (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5579399794&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58678&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58678/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58678&quot;&gt;#58678&lt;/a&gt;) and Engram host tables shared across co-located DP replicas by default (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5507296650&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57651&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57651/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57651&quot;&gt;#57651&lt;/a&gt;); encoder CUDA graphs for the vision tower (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5435038530&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56625&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56625/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56625&quot;&gt;#56625&lt;/a&gt;); and SWA bounded replay that keeps the sliding-window KV out of prefix caching (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5409331249&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56227&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56227/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56227&quot;&gt;#56227&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast restart&lt;/strong&gt;: the new &lt;code&gt;vllm preload&lt;/code&gt; CLI launches the weight-cache daemon that keeps post-quantized weights resident in GPU memory across engine restarts (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5438924463&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56680&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56680/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56680&quot;&gt;#56680&lt;/a&gt;), now with data parallelism (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5488147190&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57386&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57386/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57386&quot;&gt;#57386&lt;/a&gt;), MTP draft models (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5484215611&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57312&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57312/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57312&quot;&gt;#57312&lt;/a&gt;), a &lt;code&gt;/health&lt;/code&gt; endpoint (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5568095242&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58552&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58552/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58552&quot;&gt;#58552&lt;/a&gt;) and a readiness wait (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5554718284&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58370&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58370/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58370&quot;&gt;#58370&lt;/a&gt;). Experimental initialized-engine snapshots (&lt;code&gt;vllm snapshot create/restore&lt;/code&gt;) use CRIU to restore a fully initialized TP1 engine (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5087068737&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51360&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51360/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51360&quot;&gt;#51360&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Runner V2 and speculative decoding&lt;/strong&gt;: draft-model speculative decoding (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4476987556&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/43091&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43091/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43091&quot;&gt;#43091&lt;/a&gt;) and custom logits processors (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5427515038&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56497&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56497/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56497&quot;&gt;#56497&lt;/a&gt;) on Model Runner V2; the new LiLiCorr drafter (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5526488820&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57934&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57934/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57934&quot;&gt;#57934&lt;/a&gt;); async scheduling for DFlash (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5534934604&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58065&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58065/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58065&quot;&gt;#58065&lt;/a&gt;) with the context K/V precompute captured in the draft CUDA graph (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5504886155&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57632&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57632/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57632&quot;&gt;#57632&lt;/a&gt;); DSpark adaptive verification for Gemma4 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5481529324&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57263&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57263/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57263&quot;&gt;#57263&lt;/a&gt;) and variable-length decode for Kimi-K3 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5195659784&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/52988&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52988/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52988&quot;&gt;#52988&lt;/a&gt;); a DCP target with a non-DCP DSpark draft (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5442789553&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56723&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56723/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56723&quot;&gt;#56723&lt;/a&gt;); and MoE memory now counted during MRV2 profiling, avoiding OOMs on WideEP deployments (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5481754308&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57270&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57270/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57270&quot;&gt;#57270&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5556698068&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58411&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58411/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58411&quot;&gt;#58411&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Large scale serving&lt;/strong&gt;: MoonEP balanced EP all2all backend via &lt;code&gt;--all2all-backend moonep&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5137970062&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/52101&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52101/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/52101&quot;&gt;#52101&lt;/a&gt;), prefill context parallelism with data parallelism (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5467350849&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57075&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57075/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57075&quot;&gt;#57075&lt;/a&gt;), a low-SM multimem reduce-scatter for SM100/SM103 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5331738276&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/55072&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55072/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55072&quot;&gt;#55072&lt;/a&gt;), DeepEPv2 with sequence parallelism (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5477764840&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57210&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57210/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57210&quot;&gt;#57210&lt;/a&gt;) and EPLB with shared-expert overlap (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5479624474&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57236&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57236/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57236&quot;&gt;#57236&lt;/a&gt;), a sharding-aware NCCL M2N weight-transfer backend for RL (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5099552306&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51520&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51520/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51520&quot;&gt;#51520&lt;/a&gt;), and KV offloading back-pressure detection (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4992235060&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50045&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50045/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50045&quot;&gt;#50045&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scheduling controls&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;--max-num-active-seqs&lt;/code&gt; caps RUNNING admission independently of &lt;code&gt;max_num_seqs&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5445301125&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56758&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56758/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56758&quot;&gt;#56758&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;code&gt;--long-prefill-token-threshold&lt;/code&gt; now adapts to the number of waiting prefills instead of chunking a lone request (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5527821151&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57951&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57951/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57951&quot;&gt;#57951&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5560175979&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58459&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58459/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58459&quot;&gt;#58459&lt;/a&gt;), the waiting queue was reworked so requests already holding KV blocks are scheduled first (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5607752929&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58947&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58947/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58947&quot;&gt;#58947&lt;/a&gt;), and the KV connector + MTP deadlock under KV pressure was fixed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5469735687&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57104&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57104/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57104&quot;&gt;#57104&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HiSparse hardening&lt;/strong&gt;: MTP verification rows resolved with a union residency kernel (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5632061962&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59235&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59235/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59235&quot;&gt;#59235&lt;/a&gt;), MTP acceptance collapse under FULL graphs fixed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5637648702&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59309&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59309/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59309&quot;&gt;#59309&lt;/a&gt;), no GPU pages without host backing (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5615623375&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59036&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59036/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59036&quot;&gt;#59036&lt;/a&gt;), a chunked-prefill preemption livelock fixed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5652787506&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59494&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59494/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59494&quot;&gt;#59494&lt;/a&gt;), KV cache sized from the groups HiSparse allocates (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5648460569&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59450&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59450/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59450&quot;&gt;#59450&lt;/a&gt;), and host prefix publication and GPU prefix adoption fixes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5612253734&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59007&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59007/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59007&quot;&gt;#59007&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5635686191&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59282&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59282/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59282&quot;&gt;#59282&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security&lt;/strong&gt;: per-request &lt;code&gt;mm_processor_kwargs&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;media_io_kwargs&lt;/code&gt; are rejected unless &lt;code&gt;--trust-request-mm-kwargs&lt;/code&gt; is set (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5592655669&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58830&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58830/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58830&quot;&gt;#58830&lt;/a&gt;); prefix-cache extra keys are tagged by source so a LoRA name and a &lt;code&gt;cache_salt&lt;/code&gt; can no longer collide (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5125705463&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51899&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51899/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51899&quot;&gt;#51899&lt;/a&gt;), and the LoRA path is part of the block hash (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5639134566&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59335&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59335/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59335&quot;&gt;#59335&lt;/a&gt;); stale multimodal receiver-cache entries can no longer replace fresh payloads (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5520648719&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57833&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57833/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57833&quot;&gt;#57833&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Breaking changes&lt;/strong&gt;: per-request multimodal kwargs gated (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5592655669&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58830&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58830/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58830&quot;&gt;#58830&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;tokenizer_mode=&quot;slow&quot;&lt;/code&gt; removed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5567173751&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58545&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58545/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58545&quot;&gt;#58545&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;--enable-mamba-fine-grained-prefix-cache&lt;/code&gt; renamed to &lt;code&gt;--enable-mamba-shared-prefix-checkpoint&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5487595878&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57382&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57382/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57382&quot;&gt;#57382&lt;/a&gt;); online quantization through &lt;code&gt;quantization=&quot;fp8&quot;&lt;/code&gt; replaced by the &lt;code&gt;fp8_per_tensor&lt;/code&gt; shorthand (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5235778938&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/53585&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/53585/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/53585&quot;&gt;#53585&lt;/a&gt;) and Quark silent online quantization removed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5118993514&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51800&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51800/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51800&quot;&gt;#51800&lt;/a&gt;); the AllSpark INT8 W8A16 backend removed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5531646590&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58001&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58001/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58001&quot;&gt;#58001&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;--enforce-eager&lt;/code&gt; now also disables JIT kernel warmup (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5544264889&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58197&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58197/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58197&quot;&gt;#58197&lt;/a&gt;); XPU graphs enabled by default with &lt;code&gt;VLLM_XPU_ENABLE_XPU_GRAPH&lt;/code&gt; removed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5106102146&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51600&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51600/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51600&quot;&gt;#51600&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Release Artifacts&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Python Wheels&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Platform&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Install&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;PyPI (CUDA 13.0)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;pip install vllm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;PyPI (CUDA 13.0, uv)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv pip install vllm --torch-backend=auto&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;ROCm&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;pip install vllm --extra-index-url https://wheels.vllm.ai/rocm/0.31.0/rocm723&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;XPU&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv pip install vllm --extra-index-url https://wheels.vllm.ai/0.31.0/xpu --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/xpu --index-strategy unsafe-best-match&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Docker Images&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Platform&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Docker Image&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;CUDA 13.0 (Default)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai:v0.31.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;CUDA 12.9&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai:v0.31.0-cu129&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;ROCm&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai-rocm:v0.31.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;CPU&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai-cpu:v0.31.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;XPU&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai-xpu:v0.31.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Artifacts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pre-built release artifacts are available in the &lt;strong&gt;Assets&lt;/strong&gt; section at the bottom of this page, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source distribution tarball&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CUDA 12.9 Python wheels for x86_64 and arm64&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CUDA 13.0 Python wheels for x86_64 and arm64&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPU Python wheels for x86_64, arm64, and macOS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;XPU Python wheel for x86_64&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Model Support&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
