m-project/vllm/pull/53624&quot;&gt;#53624&lt;/a&gt;), and encoder-cache sharing over NIXL (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4833586034&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47941&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47941/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47941&quot;&gt;#47941&lt;/a&gt;) and Mooncake (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4372614161&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/41567&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/41567/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/41567&quot;&gt;#41567&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
